stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Assigned

    Assigned --> Downloading: Child or app requests activity
    Downloading --> Downloaded: Content cached successfully
    Downloading --> DownloadFailed: Network or storage failure
    DownloadFailed --> Downloading: Retry requested

    Downloaded --> InProgress: Child starts activity
    InProgress --> Paused: Child pauses or app closes
    Paused --> InProgress: Child resumes

    InProgress --> PendingSync: Response saved while offline
    PendingSync --> InProgress: Server accepts response
    PendingSync --> SyncConflict: Server state has changed
    SyncConflict --> InProgress: State reconciled
    SyncConflict --> Rejected: Event cannot be reconciled

    InProgress --> Submitted: Final response sent
    Submitted --> Evaluating: Server validates completion
    Evaluating --> Completed: Completion is valid
    Evaluating --> InProgress: Retryable validation issue
    Evaluating --> Rejected: Invalid or tampered request

    Completed --> Rewarding: Begin atomic reward transaction
    Rewarding --> Rewarded: XP, streak and rewards committed
    Rewarding --> Completed: Retryable transaction failure
    Rewarded --> Reviewed: Explanation or recap viewed
    Reviewed --> [*]

    Rejected --> [*]
